    "steam_appid": 2638790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638790/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1698650017\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Project Nasu is a 2D action and puzzle platformer where you play as a lab experiment trying to escape an evil scientist\u2019s laboratory. Play as Nasu, using his snout to fire projectiles that propel you backward to evade, and fend off threats. Solve puzzles by activating platforms and deactivating lasers to ultimately escape the facility and save Nasu.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638790/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1698650017\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Master the movement</strong> - Learn to propel yourself in all directions while simultaneously avoiding dangers.<br></li><li><strong>15 unique levels</strong> - Play through 15 fun and challenging levels to test your skills.<br>[*[b]]Completionism </li></ul>[/b]- Can you collect all the coins? Maybe you'll even be rewarded.<br><li><strong>Speedrunning </strong>- Swiftly make your way through levels with a built-in timer and system that keeps track of your best times.</li>[/list]<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638790/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1698650017\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638790/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1698650017\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Project Nasu is a 2D action and puzzle platformer where you play as a lab experiment trying to escape an evil scientist\u2019s laboratory. Play as Nasu, using his snout to fire projectiles that propel you backward to evade, and fend off threats. Solve puzzles by activating platforms and deactivating lasers to ultimately escape the facility and save Nasu.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638790/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1698650017\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Master the movement</strong> - Learn to propel yourself in all directions while simultaneously avoiding dangers.<br></li><li><strong>15 unique levels</strong> - Play through 15 fun and challenging levels to test your skills.<br>[*[b]]Completionism </li></ul>[/b]- Can you collect all the coins? Maybe you'll even be rewarded.<br><li><strong>Speedrunning </strong>- Swiftly make your way through levels with a built-in timer and system that keeps track of your best times.</li>[/list]<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638790/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1698650017\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
